---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Arnur Jumabekov"
  description="Undergrad researcher at the intersection of computer vision and robotics — medical image analysis, robotic control, and the perception-action loop."
  active="main"
>
  <section class="page-section" id="about">
    <h2 class="content-heading">About</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      I'm an undergraduate researcher working at the intersection of computer
      vision and robotics — building models that read medical images and
      control systems that move robots with precision.
    </p>
    <p class="muted body-text">
      My current focus is the perception-action loop: a vision model that
      detects disease in chest X-rays, and a control stack that turns motor
      commands into accurate motion. Both demand clean code, careful
      experiments, and results that survive contact with the data.
    </p>

    <hr class="hairline" />

    <h2 class="content-heading">Current Focus</h2>
    <ol class="entry-list">
      <li class="entry">
        <div class="entry-main">
          <h3 class="entry-title">Medical Image Analysis</h3>
          <p class="entry-meta">
            <span class="venue mono">Hybrid CNN-ViT architectures · Aug 2024 – Present</span>
          </p>
          <p class="entry-desc muted">
            Designing and ablating hybrid vision models for pneumonia detection
            in chest X-rays — published work on weighting CNN features before
            vision-transformer encoding.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="entry">
        <div class="entry-main">
          <h3 class="entry-title">Robotic Control</h3>
          <p class="entry-meta">
            <span class="venue mono">Dynamixel motors · path following · Aug 2025 – Present</span>
          </p>
          <p class="entry-desc muted">
            Building a Python API to control Dynamixel DC motors and writing
            custom path-following algorithms for a pipe-inspection robot at
            Nazarbayev University's ARMS Lab.
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <hr class="hairline" />

    <h2 class="content-heading">Research Interests</h2>
    <ul class="prose-tags">
      <li class="chip mono">Computer Vision</li>
      <li class="chip mono">Medical Image Analysis</li>
      <li class="chip mono">Robotics</li>
      <li class="chip mono">Control Systems</li>
      <li class="chip mono">Deep Learning</li>
      <li class="chip mono">Perception-Action Loop</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
